WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.417
Open an existing Catalog item to add details later.

00:03.417 --> 00:10.083
Under Print materials and costing, keep Manual for a price you set, or choose Cost plus markup to calculate one.

00:10.083 --> 00:12.833
Open Inventory if you want to track quantities.

00:12.833 --> 00:17.833
Open Additional details for a SKU, a customer description, or a category.

00:17.833 --> 00:23.250
Choose an existing category, or keep No category. Save Changes when you finish editing.

